peration not permitted (os error 1)\nmise WARN  failed to write cache file: /Users/sto/Library/Caches/mise/android-sdk/23.0/exec_env_f9003207cf9e4d4c-6a722.msgpack.z Operation not permitted (os error 1)\nLoading initial Timbre config from: :default\n\nRunning tests in #{\"test\"}\nExecution error (FileNotFoundException) at yang.correspondence-text-test/eval5402$loading (correspondence_text_test.clj:1).\nCould not locate yang/correspondence_text__init.class, yang/correspondence_text.clj or yang/correspondence_text.cljc on classpath. Please check that namespaces with dashes use underscores in the Clojure file name.\n\nFull report at:\n/var/folders/n0/xl3_1xkn0yd5trpq843l81840000gn/T/clojure-751211350534642029.edn\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > src/cljc/yang/correspondence_text.clj <<'EOF'\n(ns yang.correspondence-text\n  \\\"JVM text capture pilot. Acceptance still requires a pinned dependency closure\n   and per-compilation replay of every claimed artifact.\\\"\n  (:require [clojure.edn :as edn]))\n\n(def profile\n  {:yang.correspondence.text/schema 1\n   :host :jvm\n   :clojure-version (clojure-version)\n   :java-version (System/getProperty \\\"java.version\\\")\n   :java-vendor (System/getProperty \\\"java.vendor\\\")\n   :encoding :utf-8\n   :normalization :none\n   :printer 'clojure.core/pr-str\n   :printer-options {:meta true :length nil :level nil :readably true\n                     :dup false :namespace-maps false}\n   :reader 'clojure.edn/read\n   :reader-options {:values 1 :eof-required true :ambient-readers false\n                    :tags :unsupported}\n   :domain :edn-with-readable-metadata})\n\n(defn- kind\n  [x]\n  (cond (map? x) :map (vector? x) :vector (set? x) :set\n        (list? x) :list (sequential? x) :sequence :else :scalar))\n\n(declare faithful?)\n\n(defn- elements-faithful?\n  [a b]\n  (and (= (count a) (count b)) (every? true? (map faithful? a b))))\n\n(defn faithful?\n  \\\"Compare syntax kind, collection iteration order, scalar numeric type and\n   metadata recursively. This is deliberately stricter than Clojure equality.\\\"\n  [a b]\n  (and (= (kind a) (kind b))\n       (let [am (meta a) bm (meta b)]\n         (if (or (some? am) (some? bm))\n           (and (some? am) (some? bm) (faithful? am bm))\n           true))\n       (case (kind a)\n         :map (and (= (count a) (count b))\n                   (every? true? (map (fn [[ak av] [bk bv]]\n                                        (and (faithful? ak bk) (faithful? av bv))) a b)))\n         (:vector :list :sequence :set) (elements-faithful? a b)\n         :scalar (and (= a b) (or (not (number? a)) (= (class a) (class b)))))))\n\n(defn- refusal\n  [compilation stage cause]\n  (ex-info \\\"Text reconstruction refused\\\"\n           {:rule :correspondence/text :compilation compilation :stage stage} cause))\n\n(defn read-one\"'!\n  \"Read one EDN value, refusing all tagged values and any trailing value.\"\n  [compilation source]\n  (try\n    (let [reader (java.io.PushbackReader. (java.io.StringReader. source))\n          eof (Object.)\n          reject-tag (fn [tag _] (throw (ex-info \"Unsupported tag\" {:tag tag})))\n          reject-builtin (fn [_] (throw (ex-info \"Unsupported tag\" {})))\n          options {:eof eof :readers {'\"'inst reject-builtin 'uuid reject-builtin}\n                   :default reject-tag}\n          value (edn/read options reader)\n          trailing (edn/read options reader)]\n      (when (or (identical? eof value) (not (identical? eof trailing)))\n        (throw (ex-info \\\"Expected exactly one value\\\" {})))\n      value)\n    (catch Exception e (throw (refusal compilation :read e)))))\n\n(defn capture\"'!\n  \"Print and immediately read back an actual input, refusing lossy captures.\"\n  [compilation value]\n  (let [source (try (binding [*print-meta* true *print-length* nil *print-level* nil\n                              *print-readably* true *print-dup* false\n                              *print-namespace-maps* false]\n                      (pr-str value))\n                    (catch Exception e (throw (refusal compilation :print e))))\n        restored (read-one! compilation source)]\n    (when-not (faithful? value restored)\n      (throw (refusal compilation :fidelity nil)))\n    source))\nEOF\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.local/share/mise/shims:$PATH\"\nclojure -M:test -n yang.correspondence-text-test'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
